      "heading": "③ 公式從哪裡來",
      "body": [
        "設 $y=u_1y_1+u_2y_2$，微分：",
        "多加的條件：令括號 $=0$",
        "再微分：",
        "代入 $L[y]=y''+py'+qy$，按 $u_1,u_2$ 整理：",
        "兩個條件，兩個未知數 $u_1',u_2'$："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "y'=u_1y_1'+u_2y_2'+\\big(u_1'y_1+u_2'y_2\\big)",
        "u_1'y_1+u_2'y_2=0",
        "y''=u_1y_1''+u_2y_2''+u_1'y_1'+u_2'y_2'",
        "u_1\\underbrace{L[y_1]}_{0}+u_2\\underbrace{L[y_2]}_{0}+u_1'y_1'+u_2'y_2'=g",
        "\\begin{pmatrix}y_1&y_2\\\\y_1'&y_2'\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}u_1'\\\\u_2'\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\g\\end{pmatrix}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 公式從哪裡來（續）",
      "body": [
        "係數行列式就是 $W$；用克拉瑪公式：",
        "$W\\ne0$ 保證聯立方程有唯一解",
        "這也說明了：為什麼要先化成首項係數 1"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "u_1'=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}0&y_2\\\\g&y_2'\\end{vmatrix}}{W}=-\\frac{y_2g}{W}",
        "u_2'=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}y_1&0\\\\y_1'&g\\end{vmatrix}}{W}=\\frac{y_1g}{W}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 適用範圍與小技巧",
      "body": [
        "• 右邊 $g$ 只要連續就能用，不限家族",
        "• 需要先知道兩個齊次解 $y_1,y_2$",
        "• 係數 $p,q$ 可以是 $x$ 的函數",
        "小技巧：",
        "• 首項係數先除掉：$2y''+2y=\\sec x$ 的 $g=\\frac12\\sec x$",
        "• 積分常數不用寫",
        "• $y_p$ 裡的齊次解可以丟掉",
        "右邊是多項式、指數、正弦餘弦時，待定係數通常比較快"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 寫成一個積分",
      "body": [
        "$y''+y=g(x)$，$y(0)=y'(0)=0$",
        "$u_1'=-g\\sin x$，$u_2'=g\\cos x$；取從 0 積到 x：",
        "$y(0)=0$；$y'(x)=\\int_0^x\\cos(x-t)g(t)\\,dt$，所以 $y'(0)=0$：初始條件自動成立",
        "代 $g=\\cos x$："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "u_1=-\\int_0^x g(t)\\sin t\\,dt,\\quad u_2=\\int_0^x g(t)\\cos t\\,dt",
        "y=\\int_0^x\\big(\\sin x\\cos t-\\cos x\\sin t\\big)g(t)\\,dt",
        "y(x)=\\int_0^x\\sin(x-t)\\,g(t)\\,dt",
        "\\sin(x-t)\\cos t=\\tfrac12\\big[\\sin x+\\sin(x-2t)\\big]",
        "\\int_0^x\\tfrac12\\sin x\\,dt=\\tfrac12x\\sin x,\\qquad\\int_0^x\\tfrac12\\sin(x-2t)\\,dt=0",
        "y=\\tfrac12x\\sin x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
